# 06 — Report

<!-- GEN: Why: a revision-bound report shared only through the approved channel is the evidence trail without becoming a leak. Kind: Suggested — keep the purpose, adapt the structure; may merge into 05 (core/authoring-guide.md). -->

<!-- GEN: Rules SR13, SR14 with the workspace's report path, next role and disclosure channel. -->

Write to `{{report_location}}` (shared only via {{disclosure_channel}}):

```
Security review of <item> @ <revision>
Mode: <security role | reviewer>   Triggers: <list>
Threat model: <summary>
Authorization matrix: <n> cells, <m> with evidence
Checks / tools run: <command> → result
Findings: <table, most severe first>
Sign-off: <APPROVED | CHANGES_REQUESTED | BLOCKED> — <reason>
Rule proposals for secure-coding-standards: <if any>
```

No secrets, tokens or personal data in the report — describe them ("an API key in config/settings.py:12"), never paste them.

